0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"红方连冲中兵发动攻击，时机适宜。黑方如改走马7进5，则红可直接马七进五破双象，攻势亦很大。","text":"红方连冲中兵发动攻击，时机适宜。黑方如改走马7进5，则红可直接马七进五破双象，攻势亦很大。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"此时形势，红以车换马炮，杀开一条血路，构成了杀势，着法凶悍，是获胜的关键。以下红以车双马双炮围攻将府，轻松获胜。","text":"此时形势，红以车换马炮，杀开一条血路，构成了杀势，着法凶悍，是获胜的关键。以下红以车双马双炮围攻将府，轻松获胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"红胜。||红方杀机四伏，黑已无力回天。","text":"红胜。\n红方杀机四伏，黑已无力回天。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["广东蔡福如 先胜 浙江沈志弈"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C32 中炮过河车互进七兵对屏风马飞象"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":13,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":37,"legal_move_records":37,"annotations":5,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":5}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 广东蔡福如 先胜 浙江沈志弈","catalogue_order":27,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-2.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
